steps.prompt:
A doctor's notes from a visit:
{{brief}}

Write a summary for the patient in plain words, under these headings: What we found; What to do; Your medicines (name, how much, when and for how long, exactly as written in the notes); When to come back; Call us or 112 if (the warning signs in the notes). Explain medical words in brackets. Leave out a heading the notes say nothing about. Add nothing the notes do not say, no advice of your own. In the language of the notes.
